. card-layout test: run by run.sh in a temporary copy of sd/
card_check.s reads boast.txt, writes card.var / cardlog.txt, deletes a file, CALLs shapes.s
card_check.out expected output (with the list of files left in scripts/data)
sys_check.s runs as /sys/sys_check: data files in sys/data, CALLs shapes.s from scripts/
sys_check.out expected output (with the list of files in sys/data)
